### 36. index-tsx-for-index-route

**Severity:** WARN

**Tempting:**
```
app/routes/index.tsx
```

**Why wrong:** With `flatRoutes()` from `@react-router/fs-routes`, an index route must be `_index.tsx`. A bare `index.tsx` becomes a `/index` URL.

**Canonical:**
```
app/routes/_index.tsx       --> "/"
app/routes/products._index.tsx --> "/products"
```

Source: https://api.reactrouter.com/v7/functions/_react_router_fs_routes.flatRoutes.html

---

### 37. dotted-segment-without-underscore-breakout

**Severity:** WARN

**Tempting:**
```
app/routes/users.profile.tsx        // intended: "/users/profile" outside users layout
```

**Why wrong:** `users.profile.tsx` nests inside `users.tsx`. To break out (share URL nesting without UI nesting), use the trailing-underscore convention.

**Canonical:**
```
app/routes/users_.profile.tsx       // "/users/profile" but not nested under users.tsx layout
```

Source: https://api.reactrouter.com/v7/functions/_react_router_fs_routes.flatRoutes.html

---

### 38. missing-dollar-for-dynamic-and-splat

**Severity:** WARN

**Tempting:**
```
app/routes/products.[id].tsx        // Next.js bracket syntax
app/routes/docs.*.tsx               // glob in filename
```

**Why wrong:** v7 uses `$param` for dynamic and `$.tsx` for splat. Brackets do not match in `flatRoutes()`.

**Canonical:**
```
app/routes/products.$id.tsx         // "/products/:id"
app/routes/docs.$.tsx               // "/docs/*"
```

Source: https://api.reactrouter.com/v7/functions/_react_router_fs_routes.flatRoutes.html

