### 39. route-collision-fs-plus-manual

**Severity:** WARN

**Tempting:**
```ts
import { flatRoutes } from "@react-router/fs-routes";
import { route } from "@react-router/dev/routes";
export default [
  ...(await flatRoutes()),
  route("about", "routes/about.tsx"),       // also exists as app/routes/about.tsx
];
```

**Why wrong:** Two definitions for the same path. v7 throws a duplicate-route build error.

**Canonical:**
```ts
// Pick one. If using fs-routes, do not also declare the same path manually.
export default [...(await flatRoutes())] satisfies RouteConfig;
```

Source: https://reactrouter.com/start/framework/routing#mixing-strategies

