### 40. setsearchparams-not-functional

**Severity:** WARN

**Tempting:**
```tsx
const [params, setParams] = useSearchParams();
setParams({ page: "2" });
setParams({ sort: "asc" });   // wipes page
```

**Why wrong:** Two non-functional updates in the same tick race; the second overwrites the first.

**Canonical:**
```tsx
setParams((prev) => { prev.set("page", "2"); return prev; });
setParams((prev) => { prev.set("sort", "asc"); return prev; });
```

Source: https://reactrouter.com/api/hooks/useSearchParams

---

### 41. useblocker-without-reset

**Severity:** WARN

**Tempting:**
```tsx
const blocker = useBlocker(dirty);
// After save: form is clean but blocker is still in "blocked" state on next nav.
```

**Why wrong:** `useBlocker` keeps its `blocked` state until you call `blocker.reset()` (or `proceed()`). Forgetting it traps the user after a successful save.

**Canonical:**
```tsx
useEffect(() => {
  if (!dirty && blocker.state === "blocked") blocker.reset();
}, [dirty, blocker]);
```

Source: https://reactrouter.com/api/hooks/useBlocker

---

### 42. usefetcher-no-key-when-many

**Severity:** WARN

**Tempting:**
```tsx
{items.map((it) => {
  const fetcher = useFetcher();
  return <fetcher.Form key={it.id} />;
})}
```

**Why wrong:** Without a `key`, every row shares one fetcher slot. Submissions stomp each other; `fetcher.state` reflects whichever submitted last.

**Canonical:**
```tsx
{items.map((it) => {
  const fetcher = useFetcher({ key: `item-${it.id}` });
  return <fetcher.Form key={it.id} />;
})}
```

Source: https://reactrouter.com/api/hooks/useFetcher#key

---

### 43. lucia-still-imported

**Severity:** WARN

**Tempting:**
```ts
import { Lucia } from "lucia";
import { BetterSqlite3Adapter } from "@lucia-auth/adapter-sqlite";
export const lucia = new Lucia(/* ... */);
```

**Why wrong:** Lucia was deprecated and the maintainer archived the repo in 2025. Roll your own with `createCookieSessionStorage` + Argon2 hashing, or switch to a maintained library (`better-auth`, `auth.js`).

**Canonical:**
```ts
// app/.server/session.ts
import { createCookieSessionStorage } from "react-router";
import { env } from "./env";
export const sessionStorage = createCookieSessionStorage({
  cookie: {
    name: "__session", httpOnly: true, secure: env.NODE_ENV === "production",
    sameSite: "lax", path: "/", maxAge: 60 * 60 * 24 * 30,
    secrets: [env.SESSION_SECRET],
  },
});
```

Source: https://lucia-auth.com/

