### 45. tsc-not-in-ci

**Severity:** NIT

**Tempting:**
```json
{ "scripts": { "ci": "react-router build" } }
```

**Why wrong:** `react-router build` does not type-check. Type errors land in production. The canonical `typecheck` script runs typegen first so `Route` namespace types exist.

**Canonical:**
```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "build": "react-router build",
    "typecheck": "react-router typegen && tsc",
    "ci": "pnpm typecheck && pnpm build"
  }
}
```

Source: https://reactrouter.com/explanation/type-safety
